4858: 4.1.13.4 Hardware Interrupt Enable Register
4859:             The read and write hardware interrupt enable register (HIER) enables the
4860:             hardware interrupt requests described in Table 4-19. There is a one-to-one
4861:             correspondence between the interrupt request and enable bits. When set, a
4862:             bit in this register enables the corresponding interrupt request in the HIRR
4863:             (Section 4.1.13.1); otherwise, the request is disabled.
4864: 
4865:             When read, the HIER returns all the interrupt enables described in Table 4-15.
