The default UART provides a concrete source-level path into LCA’s assert callback. Footbridge supplies a useful implementation precedent, but its mask operations cannot be copied directly: LCA’s `line` is an index, while Footbridge’s is a bit mask. The review will distinguish forwarding, CPU dispatch, and interrupt acknowledgement so a partial repair has clear limits.
